abstract final class EnglishAdvancedUpperThirdBatch {
  static const lessons = <EnglishAdvancedLesson>[
    EnglishAdvancedLesson(level:"B2",number:3,title:"The Rooftop Energy Debate",titleArabic:"الجدل حول الطاقة فوق الأسطح",storyTitle:"The Rooftop Energy Debate",storyTitleArabic:"الجدل حول الطاقة فوق الأسطح",paragraphs:<String>["When the neighborhood association proposed a shared solar installation, residents welcomed the possibility of cheaper electricity. Yet the plan required rooftop access across several buildings, and tenants asked whether the projected savings would justify the upfront investment.","An energy engineer compared seasonal output, maintenance requirements and peak demand. She cautioned that generation would fall during cloudy months, so battery storage and grid backup remained necessary. Participants debated whether households with different consumption habits should contribute equally.","During consultation, a property owner requested a clear warranty and a transparent contract. A renter argued that low-income families could not bear the same initial cost as wealthier owners. Their argument shifted from technology to financial risk and equitable access.","After negotiation, residents approved a limited pilot installation with independent monitoring. Although the project would not eliminate every electricity bill, it would provide measurable evidence before expansion. A simplistic promise had become a more accountable community decision."],storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("neighborhood association","جمعية الحي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("solar installation","تركيب شمسي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("rooftop access","حق استخدام السطح"),EnglishAdvancedWord("projected savings","وفورات متوقعة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("upfront investment","استثمار أولي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("energy engineer","مهندس طاقة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("seasonal output","إنتاج موسمي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("maintenance requirements","متطلبات الصيانة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("peak demand","ذروة الطلب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("battery storage","تخزين البطاريات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("grid backup","دعم الشبكة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("property owner","مالك عقار"),EnglishAdvancedWord("warranty","ضمان"),EnglishAdvancedWord("pilot installation","تركيب تجريبي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("independent monitoring","رصد مستقل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("financial risk","خطر مالي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("equitable access","وصول عادل")],extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("photovoltaic array","مصفوفة ألواح ضوئية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("inverter efficiency","كفاءة المحول"),EnglishAdvancedWord("net metering","القياس الصافي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("system lifespan","عمر النظام"),EnglishAdvancedWord("power fluctuation","تقلب القدرة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("household tariff","تعرفة منزلية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("installation permit","تصريح تركيب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("roof reinforcement","تدعيم السطح"),EnglishAdvancedWord("generation capacity","قدرة توليد"),EnglishAdvancedWord("maintenance reserve","احتياطي صيانة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("energy cooperative","تعاونية طاقة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("capital contribution","مساهمة رأسمالية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("billing transparency","شفافية الفوترة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("utility interconnection","ربط مرفق الكهرباء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("load profile","ملف الأحمال"),EnglishAdvancedWord("electricity surplus","فائض كهرباء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("financial feasibility","جدوى مالية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("community ownership","ملكية مجتمعية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("energy payback","استرداد تكلفة الطاقة")],grammarTitle:"Concession and evidence-qualified projections",grammarArabic:"نستخدم Although لعرض الحجة المضادة وprovided that لتحديد الشرط وwould للنتيجة الافتراضية. لا نقدم التوقعات الفنية كضمان مالي.",grammarExamples:<String>["Although solar panels generate power, storage remains costly.","The proposal could work provided that costs are shared fairly.","We would expand the scheme if the pilot proved successful."],listening:"The committee has recommended a small initial solar pilot rather than a full neighborhood installation. Engineers estimate that rooftop generation could reduce daytime electricity purchases, but actual savings depend on the weather, maintenance and tariff arrangements. Several tenants have questioned whether they should contribute the same amount as owners. The proposal therefore includes financial assistance for households facing hardship and requires quarterly performance reports. Supporters say the trial will reveal whether solar generation is practical under local conditions. Critics acknowledge its environmental promise but warn that estimates cannot guarantee future returns. The association will examine metering records and maintenance costs before voting on expansion.",listeningQuestion:"Why does the committee prefer a limited pilot?",listeningOptions:<String>["It provides measured evidence before expansion","It guarantees free power forever","It avoids safety inspections"],listeningAnswer:0,readingQuestion:"What central issue divided tenants and owners?",readingOptions:<String>["The fair sharing of financial costs","The color of the panels","The number of buildings in the city"],readingAnswer:0,writingCue:"A manufacturer provides a product ____ for defects.",writingAnswer:"warranty"),
    EnglishAdvancedLesson(level:"C1",number:3,title:"What the River Samples Revealed",titleArabic:"ما كشفته عينات النهر",storyTitle:"What the River Samples Revealed",storyTitleArabic:"ما كشفته عينات النهر",paragraphs:<String>["A university laboratory began investigating microplastic contamination in a river that supplied drinking water to several towns. Dr. Hana, an environmental chemist, designed a sampling protocol to determine whether particles originated from wastewater, road runoff or industrial discharge. She warned that a concentration measurement alone could not identify a source.","The team collected water from upstream and downstream locations and examined its polymer composition. Initial results suggested an association with rainfall, but the pattern was inconsistent across collection dates. A field technician discovered filter contamination during transport, raising doubts about several preliminary readings.","Instead of discarding the entire dataset, Hana conducted a quality-control review and planned a new sampling campaign. She recorded laboratory blanks, reviewed the chain of custody and asked an independent colleague to repeat the most sensitive measurements. These precautions delayed publication but reduced the risk of attributing pollution to the wrong source.","The revised results suggested several contributing pathways rather than one responsible facility. Industrial discharge remained plausible, yet similar particles were detected upstream from the factory. Hana resisted any claim of causation where the observations indicated only an imperfect correlation.","At a public briefing, residents demanded immediate measures. Hana recommended better filtration and sustained monitoring while explaining that uncertainty must not become an excuse for inaction. By separating confirmed findings from competing explanations, the research offered a more credible basis for environmental policy."],storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("microplastic contamination","تلوث اللدائن الدقيقة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("environmental chemist","كيميائي بيئي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sampling protocol","بروتوكول عينات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("wastewater","مياه صرف"),EnglishAdvancedWord("road runoff","جريان مياه الطرق"),EnglishAdvancedWord("industrial discharge","تصريف صناعي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("concentration measurement","قياس التركيز"),EnglishAdvancedWord("polymer composition","تركيب البوليمر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("upstream","أعلى مجرى النهر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("downstream","أسفل مجرى النهر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("field technician","فني ميداني"),EnglishAdvancedWord("filter contamination","تلوث المرشح"),EnglishAdvancedWord("quality-control review","مراجعة ضبط الجودة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sampling campaign","حملة أخذ عينات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("laboratory blanks","عينات ضبط فارغة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("chain of custody","سلسلة حيازة العينة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("contributing pathways","مسارات مساهمة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("imperfect correlation","ارتباط غير كامل")],extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("particle characterization","توصيف جسيمات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("analytical sensitivity","حساسية تحليلية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("spectroscopic fingerprint","بصمة طيفية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("blank correction","تصحيح عينة فارغة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("replicate measurement","قياس مكرر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sample preservation","حفظ العينة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("background concentration","تركيز خلفي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("upstream control site","موقع ضبط أعلى النهر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("downstream gradient","تدرج أسفل النهر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("hydrological variation","تغير هيدرولوجي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("laboratory cross-check","فحص مخبري متقاطع"),EnglishAdvancedWord("source apportionment","توزيع مساهمات المصادر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("contaminant transport","نقل الملوث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("water treatment efficiency","كفاءة معالجة المياه"),EnglishAdvancedWord("environmental exposure","تعرض بيئي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("analytical uncertainty","عدم يقين تحليلي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("quality assurance record","سجل ضمان الجودة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("pollutant profile","بصمة الملوث"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sampling artifact","تلوث ناشئ عن العينة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("temporal variability","تباين زمني"),EnglishAdvancedWord("measurement threshold","عتبة قياس"),EnglishAdvancedWord("sediment deposition rate","معدل الترسيب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("source attribution analysis","تحليل نسبة المصادر"),EnglishAdvancedWord("instrument calibration log","سجل معايرة الجهاز")],grammarTitle:"Research caution: correlation, causation and qualified inference",grammarArabic:"في C1 نستخدم suggest وappear وcannot establish بدقة. وجود ارتباط بين الأمطار والجسيمات لا يثبت أن المطر مصدر التلوث؛ يجب تمييز الملاحظة عن تفسير السبب.",grammarExamples:<String>["The data suggest several possible sources.","The results do not establish a single cause.","It remains unclear whether the factory was the main contributor."],listening:"At a scientific briefing, Dr. Hana explained that measurements of microplastics in river water must be checked for contamination introduced by collection equipment. A filter from the initial sampling campaign had been compromised, so several readings needed to be repeated before any reliable conclusions could be drawn. The revised analysis found different types of polymer at several locations, with concentrations changing after rainfall. Although a nearby factory remained a plausible contributor, particles were also detected upstream from its discharge. The evidence therefore pointed to multiple sources rather than one obvious culprit. Hana advised officials to improve filtration, strengthen laboratory quality controls and communicate the uncertainties associated with source attribution. She emphasized that scientific caution should accompany practical environmental action instead of delaying it indefinitely.",listeningQuestion:"Why were several early measurements repeated?",listeningOptions:<String>["A filter had been contaminated","The factory had closed","The river was completely clean"],listeningAnswer:0,readingQuestion:"Why did Hana avoid blaming one factory for all the pollution?",readingOptions:<String>["Similar particles appeared upstream","The factory refused to answer questions","No water samples were available"],readingAnswer:0,writingCue:"Hana followed a strict sampling ____.",writingAnswer:"protocol"),
  ];
}
